---
description: All terminal commands must use devenv shell via lean-ctx ctx_shell
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
priority: critical
---

**MANDATORY:** Native Shell is hook-denied. Run commands via lean-ctx `ctx_shell`, and wrap ALL commands with `devenv shell --`.

```bash
# ✅ DO (via MCP ctx_shell)
devenv shell -- git status
devenv shell -- nix flake check
devenv shell -- cargo build

# ❌ DON'T — native Shell tool, or bare commands
git status
nix flake check
cargo build
```

**Applies to:** All terminal commands (git, nix, cargo, formatting, testing, etc.)
